<description>&lt;p&gt;The Tatmadaw continues cross-border strikes, bombing a health centre in Thailand's Tak province and targeting Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, while resistance drones hit a Christian Bible school in Karen State, killing three female students. An airstrike in Mrauk-U killed a pregnant woman and injured civilians, and the junta is proceeding with April parliamentary by-elections in conflict-hit Sagaing, Chin and Shan despite ongoing fighting. The military delegation returned from Laos and Myanmar participated in the HADR‑2026 disaster-relief exercise, and repurposed dead Starlink terminals are being used to locate and kill people. The UCDP recorded 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOY00zNDBlUzhxWWFrVllsZVNway1KVUFvd3hfanM5NWxRTEZqVVJkWWUzUFExV0ZEcUZWNkcyU0FPeFdZMEZUTE02VHJ2cGtXRXJFTnBhWmVTbkdCeEFUSnc2bDRLM2FkSTFqMnNNS1VwRVF1RHI1UXhveHVtZ3VsU1JRY2xGSFpFOXpZVll4WnNHa1A4TXRiaHFLYzViUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNOGlJZ19oU25UaGp0cFVNSWdpQmlTSi00X3U4Y0hMQVhMZDVnV2N0QmhnanNhXzU4eHNlc19KUmpSNWJCQlZLWGxjaGlSOFlPR1pSTVJKTjdza2lydHdIeW9oUGp3S21SOFhMUzR6NEo1b3lsem1FR242RnBXR19BZC1mZjZYSzlmXzNmSDJZb0ZJdGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Military Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQODdSMngtZzNMTGd3UmtBaVVvUnpxamdjWGtnV0VMTlRGbVRhTmFSZTJQYVZXdDlUUTBOa2RJR0lBdzl6U1ZKVVhIbHVEZXB5RkUxWjdJd09mblBXdHBGVzJtSkVVTk5yQ0hZeXA2b0gwMUMxQ3J5NzlnSDRJSGUycTBWU3V2Y3hTM3JER3Z2SjJsMUdKaERMc3dHeTVzYWI1S0lQYVdaNjBKMXZzREVXNjFVcUZwS3ZV?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Diplomat – Asia-Pacific Current Affairs Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goog